// Azure Speech call failures by operation and code, hourly (DIAAT-282). Recording
// pipeline (Phase 2): Speech.
//
// Measure: failed batch HTTP calls to Azure Speech and why.
// Formula: sum(value) of transcription.speech.call.failures per hour, by
//   speech.operation and hmcts.error.code.
// Source: counter transcription.speech.call.failures, emitted only by the recording
//   batch client, so no area filter: metric dimensions do not carry hmcts.area
//   (decision 1). Codes: speech.throttled (429), speech.http_<status>, speech.timeout,
//   speech.connect_error, speech.transport_error, speech.results_invalid,
//   unhandled.<Type>. Never sampled (OD2).
// Caveats: counts calls, not jobs: a job whose call is retried and then succeeds still
//   shows its failed attempts here.
customMetrics
| where name == "transcription.speech.call.failures"
| extend series = strcat(
    tostring(customDimensions["speech.operation"]), " ",
    tostring(customDimensions["hmcts.error.code"]))
| summarize failures = sum(value) by bin(timestamp, 1h), series
| order by timestamp asc
